---
import { getDict } from "../data/i18n";
import type { Locale } from "../data/site";
import { LINKS } from "../data/site";

interface Props {
  locale: Locale;
}

const { locale } = Astro.props;
const t = getDict(locale);
const p = t.privacy;
const isZh = locale === "zh";
---

<section class="lumi-sky pb-10 pt-12 sm:pt-16">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4 sm:px-6">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-[var(--fg)] sm:text-5xl">{p.title}</h1>
    <p class="mt-3 text-base leading-relaxed text-[var(--fg-muted)]">{p.subtitle}</p>
    <div class="mt-5 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3 text-xs">
      <span class="text-[var(--fg-muted)]">{p.sourceNote}</span>
      <a
        href={LINKS.privacyRepo}
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        class="lumi-pill border border-[var(--line)] bg-[var(--surface)] px-3 py-1 font-semibold text-[var(--accent)] no-underline hover:bg-[var(--surface-hover)]"
      >
        {p.viewPrivacyMd} ↗
      </a>
      <a
        href={LINKS.securityRepo}
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        class="lumi-pill border border-[var(--line)] bg-[var(--surface)] px-3 py-1 font-semibold text-[var(--accent)] no-underline hover:bg-[var(--surface-hover)]"
      >
        {p.viewSecurityMd} ↗
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<article class="mx-auto max-w-4xl space-y-6 px-4 py-10 text-sm leading-relaxed text-[var(--fg-muted)] sm:px-6">
  {
    isZh ? (
      <>
        <section class="lumi-panel space-y-3 p-6 sm:p-8">
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-[var(--fg)]">1. 我们不收集任何数据</h2>
          <ul class="list-disc space-y-2 pl-5">
            <li>
              Lumi <strong class="text-[var(--fg)]">不收集</strong>任何遥测数据、使用统计、自动崩溃上报、广告标识、硬件指纹或个人隐私信息。
            </li>
            <li>
              Lumi <strong class="text-[var(--fg)]">没有自建用户后台服务器</strong>，不会把你的账号凭据、世界存档、模组清单或个人设置上传到开发者的服务器。
            </li>
            <li>本官网同样不挂载第三方广告脚本、行为追踪 Cookie 或跨站统计。</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section class="lumi-panel space-y-3 p-6 sm:p-8">
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-[var(--fg)]">2. 仅保存在你本机的数据</h2>
          <ul class="list-disc space-y-2 pl-5">
            <li>
              <strong class="text-[var(--fg)]">账号摘要</strong>：显示名称、官方 Minecraft Java 版 UUID、当前选中账号以及缓存的官方皮肤预览图。
            </li>
            <li>
              <strong class="text-[var(--fg)]">认证凭据</strong>：OAuth 2.0 刷新令牌按账号隔离存放在 <strong class="text-[var(--fg)]">Windows 凭据管理器</strong>；若系统凭据库不可用，仅暂存于本次运行内存，退出即销毁。
            </li>
            <li>
              <strong class="text-[var(--fg)]">启动器与游戏数据</strong>：实例、世界存档、备份、本地偏好设置（<code>settings.json</code>）以及按天滚动的本地日志（保留 7 天，写入前自动脱敏为 <code>&lt;redacted&gt;</code>）。
            </li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section class="lumi-panel space-y-3 p-6 sm:p-8">
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-[var(--fg)]">3. 外部网络连接说明</h2>
          <p>Lumi 仅在你使用对应功能时连接必要的外部服务（请求头 User-Agent 为 <code>LumiLauncher/&lt;版本号&gt;</code>）：</p>
          <ul class="list-disc space-y-2 pl-5">
            <li><strong class="text-[var(--fg)]">Microsoft / Xbox Live / Mojang 官方服务</strong>：用于系统浏览器 OAuth 2.0 授权码 + PKCE 登录、Java 版游玩权核验、官方档案读取与官方游戏资产下载。账号认证的请求不经过任何第三方镜像。</li>
            <li><strong class="text-[var(--fg)]">模组加载器官方源</strong>（Fabric、Quilt、Forge、NeoForge）：用于列出加载器版本并下载加载器文件。</li>
            <li><strong class="text-[var(--fg)]">Modrinth 与 CurseForge</strong>：用于搜索、安装与更新模组、整合包、材质包、光影、地图与服务器。</li>
            <li><strong class="text-[var(--fg)]">可选社区下载镜像（BMCLAPI / MCIM）</strong>：Minecraft 游戏文件与元数据默认优先从 Mojang 官方源下载；仅在官方源连接失败，或你在「内容与下载」中主动改为「自动 / 优先镜像」时才使用镜像。个人 API Key 和账号认证请求绝不发给镜像。</li>
            <li><strong class="text-[var(--fg)]">DNS over HTTPS（默认开启）</strong>：海外官方源通过 Cloudflare（<code>1.1.1.1</code>）、国内镜像通过阿里公共 DNS（<code>223.5.5.5</code>）解析下载源域名，不可用时自动回退系统 DNS，可在设置中关闭。</li>
            <li><strong class="text-[var(--fg)]">下载测速与 Minecraft 服务器列表查询</strong>：仅在手动将下载源改为「自动」时短暂测速官方源与 BMCLAPI；向首页或列表里的服务器发送标准状态查询以显示在线人数与延迟。</li>
            <li><strong class="text-[var(--fg)]">可选手动日志分享（<code>mclo.gs</code>）</strong>：不会自动上传，只有在你手动点击并再次确认后，才会先脱敏再上传。</li>
            <li><strong class="text-[var(--fg)]">GitHub Releases（检查更新）</strong>：安装版每次启动拉取一次轻量的 <code>latest.json</code> 检查更新；便携版不检查更新。</li>
            <li><strong class="text-[var(--fg)]">本机 Discord 活动状态（可选，默认关闭）</strong>：仅通过本机命名管道（<code>\\.\pipe\discord-ipc-*</code>）与本机 Discord 客户端通信。</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section class="lumi-panel space-y-3 p-6 sm:p-8">
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-[var(--fg)]">4. 安全设计与更新包签名</h2>
          <ul class="list-disc space-y-2 pl-5">
            <li><strong class="text-[var(--fg)]">Java <code>stdin</code> 凭据管道</strong>：核验通过的 Minecraft 会话令牌与游戏参数经由 Java 子进程标准输入（<code>com.lumilauncher.bootstrap.SessionPipe</code>）一次性交付，不会出现在系统进程命令行、环境变量或临时参数文件里。</li>
            <li><strong class="text-[var(--fg)]">最小前端权限</strong>：WebView 前端不直接读写文件系统或执行命令，全部由强类型 Rust 命令受控执行；外部整合包与压缩包均经过路径越界、符号链接与大小写冲突校验。</li>
            <li><strong class="text-[var(--fg)]">更新包密码学签名</strong>：安装版自动更新只接受由 Lumi 更新私钥签名的更新包，安装前强制校验签名。</li>
            <li>
              <strong class="text-[var(--fg)]">注销与卸载</strong>：在 Lumi 中移除账号会立即清除 Windows 凭据管理器中的本机刷新令牌，本机登录态随即失效；如需同时撤销 Microsoft 云端对本应用的授权，可前往
              <a
                href={LINKS.microsoftConsent}
                target="_blank"
                rel="noopener noreferrer"
                class="font-semibold text-[var(--accent)] hover:underline"
              >
                Microsoft 账户应用权限管理页 ↗
              </a>
              手动移除。卸载默认保留你的游戏目录与存档。
            </li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section class="lumi-panel space-y-3 p-6 sm:p-8">
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-[var(--fg)]">5. 报告安全漏洞与联系维护者</h2>
          <p>
            请勿在公开 Issue 或聊天群披露可被利用的漏洞细节。请使用
            <a
              href={LINKS.securityAdvisory}
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
              class="font-semibold text-[var(--accent)] hover:underline"
            >
              GitHub 私密漏洞报告（Private Vulnerability Reporting）
            </a>
            联系我们（或发送邮件至{" "}
            <a
              href={LINKS.mailto}
              class="font-semibold text-[var(--accent)] hover:underline"
            >
              {LINKS.email}
            </a>
            ），我们力争在 72 小时内确认并响应。一般使用问题欢迎前往
            <a
              href={LINKS.discussions}
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
              class="font-semibold text-[var(--accent)] hover:underline"
            >
              GitHub Discussions
            </a>
            交流。
          </p>
        </section>
      </>
    ) : (
      <>
        <section class="lumi-panel space-y-3 p-6 sm:p-8">
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-[var(--fg)]">1. Data We Do NOT Collect</h2>
          <ul class="list-disc space-y-2 pl-5">
            <li>
              Lumi does <strong class="text-[var(--fg)]">not</strong> collect telemetry, usage analytics, automatic crash beacons, advertising identifiers, hardware fingerprints, or personal data.
            </li>
            <li>
              Lumi operates <strong class="text-[var(--fg)]">no backend user database</strong> and does not send your credentials, saves, mod lists, or settings to any Lumi-operated server.
            </li>
            <li>This website runs no third-party ad trackers or cross-site analytics cookies.</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section class="lumi-panel space-y-3 p-6 sm:p-8">
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-[var(--fg)]">2. Local Data Stored on Your Device</h2>
          <ul class="list-disc space-y-2 pl-5">
            <li>
              <strong class="text-[var(--fg)]">Account summary</strong>: Microsoft account display name, official Minecraft: Java Edition UUID, active account selection, and cached official skin previews.
            </li>
            <li>
              <strong class="text-[var(--fg)]">Authentication tokens</strong>: OAuth 2.0 refresh tokens are stored per account in <strong class="text-[var(--fg)]">Windows Credential Manager</strong> (or volatile session memory only if the OS vault is unavailable).
            </li>
            <li>
              <strong class="text-[var(--fg)]">Game &amp; launcher files</strong>: Instances, world saves, backups, local preferences (<code>settings.json</code>), and rolling 7-day local logs automatically redacted to <code>&lt;redacted&gt;</code>.
            </li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section class="lumi-panel space-y-3 p-6 sm:p-8">
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-[var(--fg)]">3. External Network Connections</h2>
          <p>Lumi connects only to external services required by features you initiate (identifying itself with User-Agent <code>LumiLauncher/&lt;version&gt;</code>):</p>
          <ul class="list-disc space-y-2 pl-5">
            <li><strong class="text-[var(--fg)]">Microsoft / Xbox Live / Mojang Official Services</strong>: Used for OAuth 2.0 Authorization Code + PKCE sign-in, Java Edition play entitlement verification, profile lookup, and official asset/runtime downloads. Sign-in traffic does not go through download mirrors.</li>
            <li><strong class="text-[var(--fg)]">Mod loader sources</strong> (Fabric, Quilt, Forge, NeoForge): To list and install loader files.</li>
            <li><strong class="text-[var(--fg)]">Modrinth &amp; CurseForge</strong>: To browse, install, and update mods, modpacks, shaders, resource packs, worlds, and servers.</li>
            <li><strong class="text-[var(--fg)]">Optional Download Mirrors (BMCLAPI / MCIM)</strong>: Minecraft game files and metadata use official Mojang sources first by default; mirrors are used only as fallback on failure or if you switch settings to Auto / Mirror. Personal API keys and authentication requests are never sent to mirrors.</li>
            <li><strong class="text-[var(--fg)]">DNS-over-HTTPS (on by default)</strong>: Resolves download source domains via Cloudflare (<code>1.1.1.1</code>) or AliDNS (<code>223.5.5.5</code> for mainland mirrors), falling back to system DNS automatically. Can be turned off in Settings.</li>
            <li><strong class="text-[var(--fg)]">Download speed test &amp; Minecraft server pings</strong>: Brief mirror speed check only when switched to Auto mode; standard server list status pings to servers you display.</li>
            <li><strong class="text-[var(--fg)]">Optional Manual Log Sharing (<code>mclo.gs</code>)</strong>: Triggered only after clicking upload and confirming a second dialog, with automatic secret redaction beforehand.</li>
            <li><strong class="text-[var(--fg)]">GitHub Releases (Updates)</strong>: Installed builds fetch the small <code>latest.json</code> once at startup; portable builds do not check for updates.</li>
            <li><strong class="text-[var(--fg)]">Local Discord IPC (Optional, Off by Default)</strong>: Communicates only over the local Windows named pipe (<code>\\.\pipe\discord-ipc-*</code>).</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section class="lumi-panel space-y-3 p-6 sm:p-8">
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-[var(--fg)]">4. Security Architecture &amp; Signed Updates</h2>
          <ul class="list-disc space-y-2 pl-5">
            <li><strong class="text-[var(--fg)]">Java <code>stdin</code> session pipe</strong>: Verified Minecraft session credentials and game arguments are delivered once over standard input via <code>com.lumilauncher.bootstrap.SessionPipe</code> and do not appear in process command lines, environment variables, or temporary argument files.</li>
            <li><strong class="text-[var(--fg)]">Minimal frontend capabilities</strong>: The WebView frontend has no direct filesystem or shell access. External archives are checked against path traversal, symlinks, and Windows case collisions before extraction.</li>
            <li><strong class="text-[var(--fg)]">Signed automatic updates</strong>: Installed builds verify cryptographic signatures against Lumi's updater public key before installing any update package.</li>
            <li>
              <strong class="text-[var(--fg)]">Account removal &amp; uninstall</strong>: Removing an account immediately deletes its local refresh token from Windows Credential Manager, invalidating local sign-in at once. To also revoke cloud-side Microsoft app consent, remove Lumi on your
              <a
                href={LINKS.microsoftConsent}
                target="_blank"
                rel="noopener noreferrer"
                class="font-semibold text-[var(--accent)] hover:underline"
              >
                Microsoft account app permissions page ↗
              </a>. Uninstalling preserves your game directory by default.
            </li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section class="lumi-panel space-y-3 p-6 sm:p-8">
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-[var(--fg)]">5. Vulnerability Reporting &amp; Contact</h2>
          <p>
            Please do not disclose exploitable security vulnerabilities in public issues or chat channels. Report privately via
            <a
              href={LINKS.securityAdvisory}
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
              class="font-semibold text-[var(--accent)] hover:underline"
            >
              GitHub Private Vulnerability Reporting
            </a>
            (or email{" "}
            <a
              href={LINKS.mailto}
              class="font-semibold text-[var(--accent)] hover:underline"
            >
              {LINKS.email}
            </a>
            ; target acknowledgement within 72 hours). General questions are welcome in
            <a
              href={LINKS.discussions}
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
              class="font-semibold text-[var(--accent)] hover:underline"
            >
              GitHub Discussions
            </a>.
          </p>
        </section>
      </>
    )
  }
</article>
